(25464,'en','Custom_SMS_Api_Url','API Endpoint URL',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25465,'en','Custom_SMS_Method','HTTP Method',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25466,'en','Custom_SMS_Content_Type','Content Type',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25467,'en','Custom_SMS_Sender','Sender ID / From',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25468,'en','Custom_SMS_Success_Keyword','Success Keyword (optional)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25469,'en','Custom_SMS_Headers','Request Headers',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25470,'en','Custom_SMS_Payload','Request Payload',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25471,'en','Custom_SMS_Add_Header','Add Header',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25472,'en','Custom_SMS_Add_Field','Add Field',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25473,'en','Custom_SMS_Placeholders','Available placeholders',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25474,'en','Custom_SMS_Payload_Hint','Define the request body fields. Use {phone}, {message} and {sender} as placeholders; they will be replaced at send time.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25475,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Title','How to configure',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25476,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Intro','Any SMS provider with an HTTP API can be connected. Open your provider\'s API documentation, copy the endpoint, method and field names, then map them below using the placeholders.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25477,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Placeholder_Phone','the recipient\'s phone number',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25478,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Placeholder_Message','the SMS text',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25479,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Placeholder_Sender','the Sender ID entered above',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25480,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Api_Url','The full endpoint URL from your provider\'s documentation, e.g. https://api.provider.com/sms/send. Placeholders are also allowed directly in the URL, e.g. ...?to={phone}&text={message}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25481,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Method','POST is the most common. Choose GET only if your provider expects everything in the URL — the payload fields are then sent as query parameters.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25482,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Content_Type','\"json\" sends the payload as a JSON body (application/json). \"form\" sends it as a classic HTML form (application/x-www-form-urlencoded). Check which one your provider expects; it is ignored for GET.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25483,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Sender','Your approved Sender ID or sending phone number. It only fills the {sender} placeholder — to be transmitted it must be used in the payload, headers or URL.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25484,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Success_Keyword','Optional but recommended. Some providers reply \"200 OK\" even when sending fails. Enter a word or fragment that only appears in a successful response (e.g. success). If the response does not contain it, the SMS is treated as failed.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25485,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Headers','Authentication headers required by your provider, e.g. Authorization = Bearer YOUR_API_KEY, or Api-Key = YOUR_API_KEY. Do not add Content-Type — it is set automatically.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25486,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Payload','The request body fields, named exactly as in your provider\'s documentation. Use the placeholders as values, e.g. to = {phone}, message = {message}, from = {sender}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25487,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Example','Full example',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(25488,'en','Custom_SMS_Guide_Default_Note','After saving, select \"custom\" as the Default SMS Gateway at the top of this page and submit — otherwise SMS will keep using the previously selected gateway.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
