(29558,'en','OfflinePayments','Offline Payments',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29559,'en','OfflinePaymentsIntro','Everything paid outside the system lives here: cash on delivery, mobile money, GCash, bank transfer and cash on pickup. These orders stay payment-pending until you mark them paid. GCash and Bank Transfer ask the customer for a screenshot, a reference number and the amount, which you approve on the order.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29560,'en','Online_Store','Online Store',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29561,'en','Online_Store_Enabled_Help','When disabled, the online store pages will be inaccessible.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29562,'en','Ord_Guide_Intro','How an order placed on your online store travels into your stock and your accounts, and where the money is actually recorded.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29563,'en','Ord_Guide_Lifecycle_Title','Order status',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29564,'en','Ord_Guide_MarkPaid_Note','The Payment Status shown here keeps recording the checkout choice and stays as it is. The sale is the accounting record, and it is what feeds your payment and profit reports. Use Show Payments on the sale to review or edit what you entered.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29565,'en','Ord_Guide_MarkPaid_Title','Changing a payment from pending to paid',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29566,'en','Ord_Guide_Notes_Title','Good to know',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29567,'en','Ord_Guide_PaymentStatus_Tip','Set at checkout and not editable here. Click to see how to record the payment.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29568,'en','Ord_Guide_Payment_Failed','The gateway declined the payment or the customer abandoned it. The order is cancelled automatically.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29569,'en','Ord_Guide_Payment_Intro','This column records how the customer chose to pay at checkout. It is set by the storefront and cannot be edited from this page — the money itself is tracked on the sale that confirming the order creates.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29570,'en','Ord_Guide_Payment_Paid','The customer already paid online through a payment gateway. Confirming the order creates the sale as Paid and records the payment for you — nothing else to do.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29571,'en','Ord_Guide_Payment_Pending','Cash on delivery, bank transfer or another pay-later method. Confirming the order creates the sale as Unpaid, so you record the money yourself once you collect it — see the steps below.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
