(29967,'en','Ord_Guide_Lifecycle_Cancelled','The order was dropped before confirmation, so no sale was created and no stock was deducted.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29968,'en','Ord_Guide_Lifecycle_Confirmed','You accepted the order. Stocky creates a Sale in the warehouse you picked and deducts the stock — that sale is the record your stock, payment and profit reports read from.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29969,'en','Ord_Guide_Lifecycle_Delivered','The customer received the order. This is what starts the return window.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29970,'en','Ord_Guide_Lifecycle_Pending','A new order waiting for your review. Only a pending order can be confirmed or cancelled.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29971,'en','Ord_Guide_Lifecycle_Shipped','You dispatched the order. Fulfilment only: the stock was already deducted when you confirmed.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29972,'en','Ord_Guide_MarkPaid_Step1','Confirm the order here first — confirming is what creates the sale.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29973,'en','Ord_Guide_MarkPaid_Step2','Open Sales > All Sales and find that sale (same customer, and the details page shows the online order it came from).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29974,'en','Ord_Guide_MarkPaid_Step3','Open the row actions menu and choose Create Payment.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29975,'en','Ord_Guide_MarkPaid_Step4','Enter the amount, the payment method and the date, then save. The sale moves to Partial or Paid on its own, depending on the amount.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29976,'en','Ord_Guide_Note_Cancel','Cancelling is only possible while the order is still pending. Once it is confirmed, reverse it through the sale or a customer return instead.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29977,'en','Ord_Guide_Note_Flagged','A Flagged tag means the order tripped a fraud check at checkout. Hover the tag to see the reason and review the order before confirming it.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29978,'en','Ord_Guide_Note_Preorder','Pre-order items skip the stock check, so an order containing them can be confirmed even when the quantity is not on hand yet.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(29979,'en','Ord_Guide_Note_Warehouse','The warehouse you pick when confirming decides where the stock is taken from. Warehouses that cannot cover the whole order are marked Out of Stock in that list.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
