(30826,'en','Related_Products_Hint','Pick the products shown in \"Related Products\" on this product page, in order. Leave empty to use the automatic rule (same category, then newest).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
