(30999,'en','Recon_Intro','Compares each cash and bank account’s operational balance with the General Ledger balance of its linked ledger account. This page is read-only: it never changes either balance.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31000,'en','Recon_Auto_Off','Automatic journals are switched off, so new transactions are not posted to the General Ledger and will show as missing journals. Turn them on in Settings → Feature Toggles.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000');
