(31347,'en','Int_Soon_Social_Commerce','Social commerce',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31348,'en','Slack_Hero_Desc','Post sales, purchases, payments and stock alerts into a Slack channel as they happen.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31349,'en','Slack_Incoming_Webhook_Url','Incoming webhook URL',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31350,'en','Slack_Saved_Paste_New_Url','Saved ({hint}) — paste a new URL to replace it',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31351,'en','Slack_Webhook_Help','Create one in Slack under {link}, pick the channel, then paste the URL here. It is stored write-only and never shown again in full.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31352,'en','Slack_Pick_Events','Pick the events to post',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31353,'en','Slack_Test_Sent','Test message sent — check your Slack channel.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31354,'en','Tg_Hero_Desc','Send sales, purchases, payments and expenses to a Telegram chat or group via your bot.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31355,'en','Tg_Bot_Token','Bot token',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31356,'en','Tg_Saved_Paste_New_Token','Saved ({hint}) — paste a new token to replace it',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31357,'en','Tg_Bot_Token_Help','Create a bot with {botfather} in Telegram and paste its token here. It is stored write-only and never shown again in full.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31358,'en','Tg_Chat_ID','Chat ID',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31359,'en','Tg_Chat_ID_Placeholder','e.g. -1001234567890 for a group, or a user id',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31360,'en','Tg_Chat_ID_Help','Add the bot to your group or channel, then get the chat id — for example by forwarding a message to {userinfobot}, or from the bot\'s {getUpdates} API response.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31361,'en','Tg_Pick_Events','Pick the events to send',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31362,'en','Tg_Test_Sent','Test message sent — check your Telegram chat.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31363,'en','Tg_Cron_Line_Copied','Cron line copied',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31364,'en','Tg_Guide_Lead','How to get Stocky\'s notifications into a Telegram chat, group or channel.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31365,'en','Tg_Guide_Lead_Cron','The cron line below is built for this server, so it can be copied straight onto it.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31366,'en','Tg_Guide_Set_It_Up','Set it up',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31367,'en','Tg_Guide_Step1_Title','Create the bot',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31368,'en','Tg_Guide_Step1_Body','In Telegram, open a chat with {botfather}, send {newbot}, and pick a name and a username for the bot. BotFather replies with a {botToken} such as {example} — copy it.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31369,'en','Tg_Guide_Bot_Token_Lower','bot token',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31370,'en','Tg_Guide_Step2_Title','Find the chat ID',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31371,'en','Tg_Guide_Step2_Intro','Where the messages go decides which ID you need:',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31372,'en','Tg_Guide_Own_Chat','Your own chat',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31373,'en','Tg_Guide_Own_Chat_Item','{label} — send any message to your new bot first (a bot cannot start a conversation), then message {userinfobot}: it replies with your user ID.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31374,'en','Tg_Guide_Group','A group',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31375,'en','Tg_Guide_Group_Item','{label} — add the bot to the group and post a message in it.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31376,'en','Tg_Guide_Channel','A channel',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31377,'en','Tg_Guide_Channel_Item','{label} — add the bot as an {admin} of the channel and post a message in it.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31378,'en','Tg_Guide_Administrator','administrator',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31379,'en','Tg_Guide_GetUpdates_Intro','For a group or channel, open this address in a browser with your own token in it, and refresh it after posting:',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31380,'en','Tg_Guide_GetUpdates_Note','Look for {chatId}. A group or channel ID is negative, e.g. {example} — copy all of it, minus sign included.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31381,'en','Tg_Guide_Step3_Title','Connect it here',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31382,'en','Tg_Guide_Step3_Body','On the {settings} tab paste the bot token and the chat ID, choose {allEvents} or only the ones you want ({events}…), switch on {enable} and save. Then press {sendTest}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31383,'en','Tg_Guide_State_Enabled','enabled',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31384,'en','Tg_Guide_State_Saved_Off','saved, but switched off',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31385,'en','Tg_Guide_State_Not_Configured','not configured yet',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31386,'en','Tg_Guide_Chat_Id','chat {id}',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31387,'en','Tg_Guide_How_Sent','How messages are sent',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31388,'en','Tg_Guide_A_Title','Right away — nothing to install',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31389,'en','Tg_Guide_A_Body','A sale, purchase, payment or expense saved in Stocky — at the POS or in the admin — is sent to Telegram {rightAfter} it has been saved, in the same request. No cron entry, no queue worker, and the cashier never waits for Telegram: the sale has already been answered when the message goes out.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31390,'en','Tg_Guide_Right_After','right after',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31391,'en','Tg_Guide_B_Title','The cron entry — for retries and background events',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31392,'en','Tg_Guide_B_Body','Two kinds of message wait on Telegram\'s own queue instead: a send that failed (Telegram unreachable for a moment), which is retried up to three more times over the next few minutes; and events raised outside the admin — orders imported from WooCommerce or Shopify, artisan commands. This cron entry sends them, and nothing else:',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31393,'en','Tg_Guide_B_Note','Every minute is right: a run with nothing waiting exits at once. On cPanel this goes in {cronJobs} — use the full path to PHP 8.2+ if {php} is older. On Windows, use Task Scheduler with program {php2}, arguments {args}, started in {path}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31394,'en','Tg_Guide_N_Waiting','{n} waiting to be sent',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31395,'en','Tg_Guide_Nothing_Waiting','nothing waiting',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31396,'en','Tg_Guide_N_Gave_Up','{n} gave up after retries',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31397,'en','Tg_Guide_Growing_Hint','— if this number keeps growing, the cron entry is not running.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31398,'en','Tg_Guide_Without_Cron','Without the cron entry, everything saved in Stocky still arrives instantly; you only lose the retries and the imported orders.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31399,'en','Tg_Guide_Else_Title','Everything else',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31400,'en','Tg_Guide_Else_Body','Messages for events raised in the background are delivered by the platform — there is nothing to set up.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31401,'en','Tg_Guide_Not_Arrive','If it does not arrive',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31402,'en','Tg_Guide_Err_401','{code} — the bot token is wrong. Paste it again from BotFather.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31403,'en','Tg_Guide_Err_400','{code} — wrong chat ID, or the bot is not in the group. For a personal chat, message the bot first.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31404,'en','Tg_Guide_Err_403','{code} — add the bot back to the group, or as an admin of the channel.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31405,'en','Tg_Guide_Test_Works','The test works but sales do not',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31406,'en','Tg_Guide_Test_Works_Item','{label} — check the event is ticked (or {allEvents} is chosen) and the switch is on.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31407,'en','Tg_Guide_Imported_Never','Imported orders never arrive',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31408,'en','Tg_Guide_Imported_Never_Item','{label} — the cron entry above is not running.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31409,'en','Jumia_Hero_Title','Jumia marketplace sync',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31410,'en','Jumia_Hero_Desc','Push prices and stock to your Jumia Seller Center listings and import marketplace orders as sales.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31411,'en','Jumia_Api_Url_Label','API URL (your country\'s Seller Center endpoint)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31412,'en','Jumia_Account_Email','Account email (User ID)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31413,'en','Jumia_Prices_Stock','Prices & Stock',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31414,'en','Jumia_Push_Card_Title','Push prices & stock to Jumia',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31415,'en','Jumia_Push_Desc','Sends the current price and quantity for every product (and variant) that has a SKU matching the Jumia listing\'s {sellerSku}. Updates are submitted as Seller Center feeds and applied asynchronously — the feed ID is recorded in the Logs tab, and per-item rejections appear in Seller Center\'s feed status screen.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31416,'en','Jumia_Push_Prices_Stock','Push prices & stock',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31417,'en','Jumia_Orders_Desc','Imports marketplace orders as sales (references like {ref}), matched to your products by Seller SKU. Already-imported and cancelled orders are skipped, so pulling regularly is safe. Payments are marked paid only for delivered orders (Jumia is COD-dominant).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31418,'en','Jumia_Guide_1','In Jumia {sellerCenter}, open Settings → {integrationMgmt} and generate an API key.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31419,'en','Jumia_Guide_2','Enter your country\'s API URL (e.g. {ng} for Nigeria, {ke} for Kenya, {eg} for Egypt), your Seller Center account email, and the key — then run {test}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31420,'en','Jumia_Guide_3','Make sure each Jumia listing\'s {sellerSku} equals the Stocky product code — that is the identity used for both stock pushes and order matching.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31421,'en','Jumia_Guide_4','Push prices & stock after inventory changes; pull orders regularly (Jumia has no webhooks in this API).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31422,'en','Jumia_Guide_5','Creating new listings stays in Seller Center — Jumia requires category-specific attributes and image review that only their portal handles well.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31423,'en','Mc_Hero_Title','Mailchimp audience sync',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31424,'en','Mc_Hero_Desc','Keep a Mailchimp audience filled with your customers, so you can run email campaigns on your real customer base.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31425,'en','Mc_Account_Audience','Account & audience',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31426,'en','Mc_Api_Key_Placeholder','e.g. a1b2c3…-us14 (Account → Extras → API keys)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31427,'en','Mc_Audience','Audience',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31428,'en','Mc_N_Members','({n} members)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31429,'en','Mc_Load_Audiences_To_Pick','Load audiences to pick one',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31430,'en','Mc_Load_Audiences','Load audiences',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31431,'en','Mc_Double_Opt_In_Label','Double opt-in — new members get a confirmation email before joining',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31432,'en','Mc_Recommended_GDPR','(recommended for GDPR)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31433,'en','Mc_Auto_Sync_New','Auto-sync new customers as they are created',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31434,'en','Mc_With_Email','With an email',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31435,'en','Mc_Push_Desc','Upserts every customer that has an email address into the selected audience (name and phone included). Existing members keep their subscription status — nobody who unsubscribed is re-subscribed. Customers without an email are left out.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31436,'en','Mc_Double_Opt_In_Off','Double opt-in is off',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31437,'en','Mc_Double_Opt_In_Off_Desc','New members will be added as subscribed without a confirmation email. Only do this for customers who already agreed to receive marketing.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31438,'en','Mc_Guide_1','In Mailchimp, open {path} and create a key (it ends in {suffix} — that suffix is your datacenter).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31439,'en','Mc_Guide_2','Paste the key here, save, then click {load} and pick the audience to fill.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31440,'en','Mc_Guide_3','Leave {doi} on unless your customers have already consented to marketing emails.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31441,'en','Mc_Double_Opt_In_Lower','double opt-in',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31442,'en','Mc_Guide_4','Run {push} for the initial fill; turn on {autoSync} so new customers join automatically.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31443,'en','Mc_Auto_Sync_Lower','auto-sync',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31444,'en','Mc_Consent_Matters','Consent matters',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31445,'en','Mc_Consent_Desc','Emailing people who never agreed to marketing can violate GDPR/CAN-SPAM and get your Mailchimp account suspended. Double opt-in shifts the confirmation to Mailchimp — the safe default.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31446,'en','Mc_No_Audiences','No audiences found on this account.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31447,'en','Presta_Hero_Desc','Sync products, stock and orders with your PrestaShop store over its webservice API.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31448,'en','Presta_Webservice_Key','Webservice key',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31449,'en','Presta_Key_Placeholder','From Advanced Parameters → Webservice',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31450,'en','Presta_Key_Help','Enable the webservice in PrestaShop (Advanced Parameters → Webservice), create a key with permissions on products, stock_availables, orders and customers, and paste it here. Stored write-only.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31451,'en','Presta_Shop_Language_ID','Shop language ID',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31452,'en','Presta_Language_Help','Language id used for product names when pushing (1 = the shop\'s first language).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31453,'en','Presta_Push_Desc','Creates missing simple products on PrestaShop (with their current stock). Already-linked products and variant products are skipped — keep editing product details in PrestaShop, or pull to refresh the local copy.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31454,'en','Presta_Pull_Desc','Imports PrestaShop products, matching existing ones by reference (SKU) and creating the rest. Combinations are imported as their parent product.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31455,'en','Presta_Reset_Confirm','Reset product links? Order history keeps its links.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31456,'en','Presta_Stock_Desc','Updates the shop\'s stock (stock_availables) for every linked product.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31457,'en','Presta_Orders_Desc','Imports shop orders as sales (references like {ref}), newest first. Already-imported and cancelled orders are skipped, so pulling regularly is safe. PrestaShop has no webhooks — run this after busy periods.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31458,'en','Presta_Guide_1','In your PrestaShop back office, open {path} and enable the webservice.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31459,'en','Presta_Guide_2','Add a new key, granting {vae} on {products} and {stock}, and {view} on {orders} and {customers}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31460,'en','Presta_Guide_3','Paste the store URL and the key on the Connection tab, save, and run {test}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31461,'en','Presta_Guide_4','Pull products first if the shop already has a catalog (matches by reference/SKU); push to create missing simple products.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31462,'en','Presta_Guide_5','Push stock whenever quantities change, and pull orders regularly — PrestaShop has no webhooks, so orders only arrive when you pull.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31463,'en','Presta_Identity_Title','Product identity is the reference (SKU)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31464,'en','Presta_Identity_Desc','Stocky\'s product code is matched to PrestaShop\'s reference. Keep references consistent on both sides; combinations (variants) are matched in orders by reference but are not pushed in this version.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31465,'en','Gs_Hero_Title','Google Sheets exports',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31466,'en','Gs_Hero_Desc','Export your sales, products and customers into a live Google spreadsheet — one tab each, refreshed on demand.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31467,'en','Gs_OAuth_Credentials','Google OAuth credentials',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31468,'en','Gs_Secret_Placeholder','From your Google Cloud OAuth client',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31469,'en','Gs_Auto_Export_Nightly','Auto-export nightly',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31470,'en','Gs_Auto_Export_Hint','(all tabs refreshed around 02:30 server time)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31471,'en','Gs_Enable_Exports','Enable Google Sheets exports',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31472,'en','Gs_Account_Spreadsheet','Account & spreadsheet',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31473,'en','Gs_Connect','Connect Google account',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31474,'en','Gs_Reconnect','Reconnect Google account',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31475,'en','Gs_Disconnect_Confirm','Disconnect the Google account? Exports stop until you reconnect.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31476,'en','Gs_Target_Spreadsheet','Target spreadsheet (ID or full URL)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31477,'en','Gs_Spreadsheet_Placeholder','Paste a spreadsheet URL, or create one →',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31478,'en','Gs_Create_New','Create new',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31479,'en','Gs_Open_Spreadsheet','Open the spreadsheet ↗',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31480,'en','Gs_Last_Export','Last export {date}',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31481,'en','Gs_Redirect_Uri_Title','Redirect URI for the Google OAuth client',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31482,'en','Gs_Export_Desc','Each export rewrites its tab from scratch (header + all rows), so the sheet is always a complete, current snapshot. Large datasets are sent in batches — leave the page open until the counter stops.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31483,'en','Gs_Export_Sales','Export sales',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31484,'en','Gs_Export_Products','Export products',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31485,'en','Gs_Export_Customers','Export customers',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31486,'en','Gs_Job_Sales_Desc','Every sale with customer, totals, payment status and warehouse.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31487,'en','Gs_Job_Products_Desc','The full catalog with prices, costs and current stock quantities.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31488,'en','Gs_Job_Customers_Desc','All customers with their contact details.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31489,'en','Gs_Guide_1','Create a project on {console} and enable the {api} (APIs & Services → Library).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31490,'en','Gs_Guide_2','Configure the {consent} (External). While it stays in \"Testing\", add your Google account as a test user — note that testing-mode refresh tokens expire after 7 days, so {publish} the app for a permanent connection.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31491,'en','Gs_OAuth_Consent_Screen','OAuth consent screen',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31492,'en','Gs_Publish','publish',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31493,'en','Gs_Guide_3','Create an {clientId} of type Web application and register the redirect URI shown on the Connection tab.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31494,'en','Gs_OAuth_Client_ID','OAuth client ID',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31495,'en','Gs_Guide_4','Paste the Client ID and Secret here, save, and click {connect}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31496,'en','Gs_Guide_5','Create a spreadsheet with the button (or paste the URL of one your Google account can edit), then run the exports.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31497,'en','Gs_Snapshots_Title','Snapshots, not live sync',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31498,'en','Gs_Snapshots_Desc','Exports rewrite the Sales / Products / Customers tabs on demand. For live row-by-row updates on every sale, connect Zapier — it can append rows the moment events fire.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31499,'en','Gs_Connected_Spreadsheet','Connected — spreadsheet: {title}',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31500,'en','Gs_Spreadsheet_Created','Spreadsheet created.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000');
INSERT INTO `translations` (`id`, `locale`, `key`, `value`, `is_default`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(31501,'en','Gs_Account_Connected','Google account connected.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31502,'en','Xero_Hero_Title','Xero accounting sync',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31503,'en','Xero_Hero_Desc','Push your customers as Xero contacts and your sales as invoices — with payments when a bank account is configured.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31504,'en','Xero_App_Credentials_Accounts','App credentials & accounts',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31505,'en','Xero_From_Your_App','From your app on developer.xero.com',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31506,'en','Xero_Sales_Account_Code','Sales account code',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31507,'en','Xero_Sales_Account_Help','Revenue account for invoice lines (\'200\' is Xero\'s default Sales account).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31508,'en','Xero_Payment_Account_Code','Payment account code (optional)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31509,'en','Xero_Payment_Code_Placeholder','e.g. 090',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31510,'en','Xero_Payment_Account_Help','A bank account code. When set, paid sales also record a payment on the invoice; leave empty to sync invoices only.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31511,'en','Xero_Auto_Sync','Auto-sync new sales as invoices',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31512,'en','Xero_Auto_Sync_Hint','(queued in the background as sales are created)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31513,'en','Xero_Org_Connection','Organisation connection',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31514,'en','Xero_Organisation','Organisation',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31515,'en','Xero_Disconnect_Confirm','Disconnect the Xero organisation? Sync stops until you reconnect.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31516,'en','Xero_Redirect_Uri_Title','Redirect URI for the Xero app',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31517,'en','Xero_Redirect_Help','Create a \"Web app\" on {link} and register this redirect URI. Note: Xero access tokens auto-refresh, but a connection idle for over 60 days must be reconnected.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31518,'en','Xero_Contacts_In_Xero','Contacts in Xero',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31519,'en','Xero_Invoices_In_Xero','Invoices in Xero',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31520,'en','Xero_Payments_Recorded','Payments recorded',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31521,'en','Xero_Push_Customers_Desc','Creates or updates a Xero contact for every customer. A customer whose name already exists in Xero is linked to that contact.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31522,'en','Xero_Push_Sales_As_Invoices','Push sales as invoices',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31523,'en','Xero_Push_Invoices_Desc','Creates one AUTHORISED invoice per sale (invoice number = the sale Ref), with the sale\'s line items plus shipping, discount and tax lines so the Xero total matches the sale total. Sales already in Xero are skipped — invoices are never edited. Missing contacts are created on the fly.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31524,'en','Xero_Push_Invoices','Push invoices',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31525,'en','Xero_Reset_Contact_Confirm','Reset contact links? The next push re-links or recreates them.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31526,'en','Xero_Reset_Contact_Links','Reset contact links',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31527,'en','Xero_Guide_1','Create a {webApp} on {link} (My Apps → New app).',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31528,'en','Xero_Web_App','Web app',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31529,'en','Xero_Guide_2','Register the redirect URI shown on the Connection tab.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31530,'en','Xero_Guide_3','Copy the app\'s {clientId} and generate a {clientSecret}; paste both here and save.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31531,'en','Xero_Guide_4','Click {connect}, sign in and pick the organisation to connect.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31532,'en','Xero_Guide_5','Check the account codes: the sales account receives invoice lines; set a bank account code if paid sales should also record payments.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31533,'en','Xero_Guide_6','Push customers first, then invoices. Invoice numbers are the sale Refs, so duplicates are rejected by Xero even if links are reset.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31534,'en','Xero_Tax_Inclusive_Title','Amounts are pushed tax-inclusive as-is',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31535,'en','Xero_Tax_Inclusive_Desc','Invoices use NoTax lines mirroring the sale exactly (items + shipping − discount + tax), so Xero totals always equal Stocky totals. Your accountant can remap the tax and shipping lines to proper accounts inside Xero.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31536,'en','Xero_Org_Connected','Xero organisation connected.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31537,'en','Salla_Hero_Desc','Sync products, stock and orders with your Salla store — orders arrive automatically via webhooks.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31538,'en','Salla_App_Credentials','App credentials',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31539,'en','Salla_From_Partners_App','From your Salla Partners app',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31540,'en','Salla_Webhook_Secret','Webhook Secret',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31541,'en','Salla_Webhook_Secret_Placeholder','Signature secret from the Webhooks page of your app',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31542,'en','Salla_Token_Expires','Token expires',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31543,'en','Salla_Disconnect_Confirm','Disconnect the Salla store? Sync stops until you reconnect.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31544,'en','Salla_Urls_Title','URLs for the Salla Partners portal',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31545,'en','Salla_OAuth_Callback','OAuth callback',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31546,'en','Salla_Webhook_Url_All','Webhook URL (all events)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31547,'en','Salla_Urls_Help','Set both in your app on {link}, choose the {signature} webhook security strategy, and subscribe to the order, product and app events.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31548,'en','Salla_Variants_Linked','Variants linked',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31549,'en','Salla_Push_Desc','Creates or updates simple products on Salla by SKU. Variant products are skipped in this version — pull them from Salla instead, or match them by SKU.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31550,'en','Salla_Only_Unlinked','Only products not linked yet',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31551,'en','Salla_Pull_Desc','Imports Salla products (variants included), matching existing ones by SKU and creating the rest.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31552,'en','Salla_Reset_Confirm','Reset product & variant links? Order history keeps its links.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31553,'en','Salla_Stock_Desc','Sends current quantities for every linked product (by SKU) and linked variant.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31554,'en','Salla_Orders_Desc','New Salla orders normally arrive on their own through webhooks and become sales. Use this pull to backfill orders placed before the webhook was set up — already-imported orders are skipped.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31555,'en','Salla_Guide_1','Create a (private) app on {link} and pick the {mode} authorization flow.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31556,'en','Salla_Guide_2','Copy the app\'s {clientId} and {clientSecret} into the Connection tab and save.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31557,'en','Salla_Guide_3','In the app\'s settings, set the OAuth callback URL shown on the Connection tab.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31558,'en','Salla_Guide_4','On the app\'s Webhooks page: choose the {signature} security strategy, copy its secret into the Webhook Secret field here, set the Webhook URL shown on the Connection tab, and subscribe at least to {e1}, {e2}, {e3}, {e4}, {e5} and {e6}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31559,'en','Salla_Guide_5','Click {connect} and approve the app on your store. (Apps in Easy Mode connect automatically through the {webhook} webhook instead.)',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31560,'en','Salla_Guide_6','Pull or push products, then push stock. New orders arrive automatically and appear under Sales with references like {ref}.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31561,'en','Salla_Identity_Title','Product identity is the SKU',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31562,'en','Salla_Identity_Desc','Stocky\'s product code is matched to Salla\'s SKU. Keep SKUs consistent on both sides; variant products are matched on pull and in orders, but are not pushed in this version.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31563,'en','Salla_Store_Connected','Salla store connected.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31564,'en','Mrp_Boms_Subtitle','What each product is made of, and how it is made.',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
(31565,'en','Mrp_Could_Not_Duplicate_Bom','Could not duplicate that BOM',1,'2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000','2026-10-20 00:29:25.000000'),
